  "code" : "public int[] singleNumberIII(int[] nums) {\n    int xorAll = 0;\n    for (int num : nums) xorAll ^= num;\n    int diffBit = xorAll & (-xorAll);\n    int a = 0, b = 0;\n    for (int num : nums) {\n        if ((num & diffBit) != 0) {\n            a ^= num;\n        } else {\n            b ^= num;\n        }\n    }\n    return new int[]{a, b};\n}",
